594, "content", "ically advances the frontier. Timing must distinguish"], [0.967253, "content", " between host preparation, visual preprocessing, text"], [0.990186, "content", " prefill, and the first output token"], [1.012508, "content", "; file"], [1.035128, "content", " reading"], [1.058377, "content", " or model loading must not be mixed"], [1.081444, "content", " into throughput metrics.\n\n**Part "], [1.104694, "content", "3: Decoding**\nStandard"], [1.127832, "content", " decoding commits one token per iteration"], [1.150027, "content", ","], [1.172543, "content", " whereas speculative decoding can verify multiple candidates and"], [1.195316, "content", " commit a contiguous"], [1.217839, "content", " prefix. Regardless of how many candidates are"], [1.240447, "content", " accepted, the public output, KV cache"], [1.26285, "content", ", loop"], [1.285381, "content", " state, and counters must all correspond to"], [1.308511, "content", " the same committed position;"], [1.331574, "content", " partially"], [1.354705, "content", " updated state is"], [1.377477, "content", " not permitted.\n\n**Part 4"], [1.400294, "content", ": Long Context**\nAs context"], [1.423089, "content", " grows, latency"], [1.445633, "content", " is jointly"], [1.468527, "content", " determined by fixed-weight"], [1.491134, "content", " reads and the"], [1.514134, "content", " continuously"], [1.536515, "content", " expanding"], [1.558985, "content", " attention cache reads. Reports should provide"], [1.581563, "content", " absolute"], [1.604822, "content", " speed, relative retention rate"], [1.627885, "content", ", and actual"], [1.650649, "content", " prompt token count, while also documenting"], [1.673458, "content", " cache format, maximum capacity, sampler configuration"], [1.6972, "content", ", and graph execution status"], [1.720077, "content", ".\n\n**Part 5: Rep"], [1.742523, "content", "roducibility**\nStable inputs must"], [1.765173, "content", " be saved as the"], [1.787455